---
// "Ready to work with us?" full-bleed CTA (Figma node 1:1332), shared by all pages.
---

<section class="section-px relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-clip" data-node="1:1332">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/assets/cta-section-ad519fca.jpg" alt="" class="absolute size-full object-cover" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container-site relative flex min-h-[420px] items-center justify-center py-16 xl:h-[543px]">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-[42px] text-center" data-reveal>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-offwhite">
        <h2 class="h1 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-[10px]">
          <span class="opacity-60">Ready to</span>
          <span>work with us?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="body-lg max-w-[540px] text-center">
          Tell us what you're building, upgrading, or solving. We'll come back with a clear, scoped quotation — not a
          sales pitch.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/quote" class="btn-white w-[142px]">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
